Initialization
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
System Construction
lattice bcc 3.3
region proj block 0 20 0 20 0 20
region targ block 0 20 0 20 21 60
region whole union 2 proj targ
create_box 1 whole
create_atoms 1 region proj
create_atoms 1 region targ
group projectile region proj
group target region targ
Potential
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
Miscellaneous
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix eq all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
timestep 0.001
run 100000
unfix eq
displace_atoms target move 0 0 0.4545454545454546 units lattice
velocity projectile set 0 0 -2000 units box
Production Run
fix nve all nve
run 200000
